# The FUG shortcut refuses what it used to substitute for, and says why.
# Former gate: check_shortcut_column_refusals.py.  shortcutColumn had three places
# where an absence came back as a number at exit 0: (1) a failed feed bubble point
# fell back on the feed's declared temperature; (2) the operating reflux defaulted
# to 1.3 * Rmin; (3) an unformable Kirkbride feed stage was published as 0.0.
# Arm (c) does NOT exercise the withholding of (3): both routes to it are refused
# earlier by Underwood's no-sign-change check, so (c) pins that unreachability.
# Says nothing about whether FUG's answer is right; the product temperatures are
# still both the FEED bubble point (a recorded gap).
group      shortcut-column-refusals
row        shortcut-column-refusals-gate
binary     choupoSolve
base       tutorials/steady/distillation/shortcut01_benzene_toluene
timeout    300
ok_head    "OK check_shortcut_column_refusals: "
fail_head  "FAIL check_shortcut_column_refusals:"
bullet     plain
ok         the witness still answers; a case with no declared reflux is refused naming
+          both spellings and the computed R_min; a feed whose bubble point cannot be found
+          is refused instead of falling back on the declared temperature; and an an
+          unformable feed stage is WITHHELD rather than published as 0 -- but that last
+          branch is LATENT, not live: both routes to it are refused earlier by Underwood,
+          so arm (c) pins the unreachability and NOT the withholding itself.  Says nothing
+          about whether FUG's answer is right, and does not cover the product temperatures
+          (both still the FEED bubble point).

control    the shipped witness still runs and still answers
  match    Shortcut Column \(FUG\)
  match    feed at stage

probe      (a) no reflux declared -> refuse, naming BOTH keys and R_min
  edit     system/flowsheetDict	re:refluxFactor\s+[\d.]+\s*;	
  match    refluxFactor
  match    refluxRatio
  match    no operating reflux
  match    R_min for this feed[^.]*is \d

probe      (b) bubble point cannot converge -> refuse, never substitute
  edit     0/feed	re:^P\s+\S+\s*(\S*)\s*;	P 500 bar;
  match    FEED BUBBLE POINT did not
  match    every relative volatility
  match    Remedies

probe      (c) no heavy key in the feed (refused earlier, by Underwood)
  edit     0/feed	re:toluene\s+\S+\s+\S+;	toluene 0 kmol/h;
  match    Underwood's equation does not change sign

probe      (c) no light key in the feed (refused earlier, by Underwood)
  edit     0/feed	re:benzene\s+\S+\s+\S+;	benzene 0 kmol/h;
  match    Underwood's equation does not change sign
